# 75
#title chore: release 0.4.4
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/75
#branch chore/release-0.4.4
#base origin/main
#opened 2026-11-19
#head 83a428837233be047d1c1b99257810d069c7355a
#summary Lantern 0.4.4: update checks on wake and focus, and a shorter Plans strip
#describe what Releases Lantern 0.4.4: version 0.4.4 and its changelog section.
#describe before 0.4.3 was the latest release; new releases were found only at start, every four hours or after toggling the update check, and the Plans strip listed every plan.
#describe after 0.4.4 also checks for updates on wake, unlock and window focus, and the Plans strip shows five plans with More and Done lists.
#describe verified Typecheck and lint green; the full suite passes apart from one known timing flake in pr-explain-service on the same code as main.
~ CHANGELOG.md
~ package.json
#order package.json
#order CHANGELOG.md
#reason CHANGELOG.md Gives users the 0.4.4 notes and the compare links, as earlier releases did
#reason package.json The release tag v0.4.4 must match the version the packaged app reports
#story A maintainer ships Lantern 0.4.4
#step actor Maintainer
#step action merges this and tags
#file package.json
#step subject the 0.4.4 release
#file CHANGELOG.md
#below actor Lantern user
#below interaction can read what 0.4.4 changed and fixed
#below consequence 0.4.3 is the latest release => 0.4.4 is the latest release
